                                <ol>
                                    <li>From your dashboard, find the "🚀 Advanced AI Features" section</li>
                                    <li>Click <strong>"Smart Categorization"</strong></li>
                                    <li>Review suggested categories with confidence scores</li>
                                    <li>Accept suggestions or make corrections to improve accuracy</li>
                                    <li>AI learns from your corrections for future suggestions</li>
                                </ol>
                                
