                                <ul>
                                    <li><span class="badge bg-success">85-100%</span> High confidence - Generally accurate</li>
                                    <li><span class="badge bg-warning">70-84%</span> Medium confidence - Review recommended</li>
                                    <li><span class="badge bg-danger">Below 70%</span> Low confidence - Manual verification needed</li>
                                </ul>
