                                <p>Add any combination of these API keys to <code>appsettings.json</code> for enhanced AI responses:</p>
                                <ul>
                                    <li><strong>GROK API</strong> (Primary) - Most advanced responses</li>
                                    <li><strong>OpenAI API</strong> (Secondary) - Reliable fallback option</li>
                                    <li><strong>Google Gemini API</strong> (Tertiary) - Free alternative</li>
                                    <li><strong>Built-in Fallback</strong> - Always available offline mode</li>
                                </ul>
                                <p><small>The system automatically tries providers in priority order and falls back to built-in responses if all APIs are unavailable.</small></p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <h6>Best Practices:</h6>
                                <ul>
                                    <li><strong>Regular Usage:</strong> Use AI features weekly for best results</li>
                                    <li><strong>Data Quality:</strong> Ensure transactions have descriptive names</li>
                                    <li><strong>Feedback:</strong> Correct AI suggestions to improve accuracy</li>
                                    <li><strong>Pattern Building:</strong> Use consistent merchant names</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="alert alert-success">
                            <i class="bi bi-check-circle"></i> <strong>Remember:</strong> All AI features include intelligent fallbacks and multiple provider support that works even without internet connectivity or external APIs. The system automatically uses the best available provider: GROK → OpenAI → Google Gemini → Built-in Fallback.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
/* Smooth scrolling for anchor links */
html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

/* Highlight active sidebar links */
.list-group-item-action:hover {
    background-color: var(--bs-light);
}

/* Custom styling for code blocks */
code {
    background-color: #f8f9fa;
    padding: 2px 4px;
    border-radius: 3px;
}
</style>

<script>
// Update active sidebar links on scroll
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
    const sections = document.querySelectorAll('section[id]');
    const navLinks = document.querySelectorAll('.list-group-item-action');
    
    function updateActiveLink() {
        let current = '';
        sections.forEach(section => {
            const sectionTop = section.getBoundingClientRect().top;
            if (sectionTop <= 100) {
                current = section.getAttribute('id');
            }
        });
        
        navLinks.forEach(link => {
            link.classList.remove('active');
            if (link.getAttribute('href') === `#${current}`) {
                link.classList.add('active');
            }
        });
    }
    
    window.addEventListener('scroll', updateActiveLink);
    updateActiveLink(); // Initial call
});
</script>